<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>It is unlawful for any proprietor or publisher of any newspaper or periodical, including any newspaper or periodical published over the Internet, willfully and knowingly to misrepresent the circulation of the newspaper or periodical, for the purpose of securing advertising or other patronage.</p></caml:Content>